B.Yq=new A.aP(B.G,B.a7,5,"G and H: Index Stretch","Stretch your index fingers sideways to G (left) and H (right).","hah gg fh agg hg gh hh gg ghg fg kh gg hhh hj hh hh kh kg agg ggg khk hhh ah kgk ghg hgh dgg dhh gg gjg hha ghg",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","gh","Left index: G \xb7 Right index: H","Stretch the index finger sideways, then return it to F or J straight away.")
