B.YH=new A.aP(B.G,B.a7,9,"R and U: Index Fingers Up","Reach up with your index fingers to R (left) and U (right).","uuj rr uru jr srs ur rrr uu ur rrl rrr srs rrr uhu uuu rrr huu uu rd rr rude ruled user dark lurk sure hurdle fur rug jug hug rush real raised rid ride rural surf slur lure sulk",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ru","Left index: R \xb7 Right index: U",u.v)
B.YS=new A.aP(B.G,B.a7,10,"T and Y: Index Stretch Up","Stretch your index fingers to T (left) and Y (right).","yt tt ttj tkt yyy yty lt yy yt yys ftt ete tt tyt ttt yl yyy ti ty yyl that they tall study dusty stay yet tray style turtle tail fifty guilty hasty yard duty tidy lately daily safety thirsty",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ty","Left index: T \xb7 Right index: Y","Use the same index finger that types R or U \u2014 just stretch it one key further.")
