B.Yd=new A.aP(B.G,B.ak,39,"Short Sentences","Short, natural sentences.","The sun is bright today. We went to the market. She reads a book every night. Please close the door. My brother plays cricket. The tea is hot. Tomorrow we will visit the park.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Press Space with your thumb. Try to keep an even rhythm.")
B.Yh=new A.aP(B.G,B.ak,40,"Longer Sentences","Longer sentences with commas and periods.","When the rain stopped, we walked to the old bridge, and the whole city looked fresh and quiet. Although it was late, Ali finished his work, checked it twice, and then went home.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Commas and periods are part of the rhythm \u2014 do not skip them.")
B.XT=new A.aP(B.G,B.ak,41,"Paragraph Practice",u.m,"Learning to type well takes patience. At first, your fingers feel slow and clumsy, but every day they remember a little more. After a few weeks, you will type without looking at the keys, and your speed will grow naturally.",90,0,"Stage 7 \xb7 Words & Sentences","","All ten fingers","Accuracy first. Speed comes by itself.")
B.cT=new A.lT(2,"advanced")
B.XR=new A.aP(B.G,B.cT,42,"Accuracy Challenge","Type slowly and aim for 95% accuracy.",'Quietly, the quick zebra jumped over six wooden boxes. Seven brave judges examined fifty-two huge frozen jars. "Why, exactly?" asked Ms. Vaz. Perfect practice makes progress.',95,0,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.s)
B.YY=new A.aP(B.G,B.cT,43,"Speed Builder 1","Reach 15 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","We like to walk by the river in the morning. The air is cool and the birds sing in the trees. After a short rest, we drink tea and talk about our day.",90,15,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 15 WPM. Keep your eyes on the screen.")
B.YV=new A.aP(B.G,B.cT,44,"Speed Builder 2","Reach 20 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","A good habit is built one day at a time. If you practise a little every day, your hands learn the path between the keys, and typing begins to feel as natural as walking.",90,20,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 20 WPM. Do not rush the hard words.")
B.YR=new A.aP(B.G,B.cT,45,"Speed Builder 3","Reach 25 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","The best way to improve is to relax your shoulders, breathe, and let your fingers do the work. Fast typists are not tense; they are smooth. Smooth leads to fast, and fast follows when you stay calm.",90,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 25 WPM. Smooth beats tense.")
B.Ye=new A.aP(B.G,B.cT,46,"Final Test","Show what you have learned: 25 WPM and 95% accuracy.","Touch typing is a skill that stays with you for life. Today you have learned every key, every finger, and how to keep a steady rhythm. Keep practising, keep your accuracy high, and your speed will continue to grow week after week.",95,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.W)
